  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participating in the democratic governance of rural land tenure security (PAGEFOR) in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project worked to strengthen sustainable and inclusive governance of the State-led land tenure and conservation process in the country. To this end, inclusive dialogues and consultations were organised with relevant stakeholders and local actors, through intra and inter-community focus groups and interviews.</narrative>
  </description>
